{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1", "title": "YGSTUDY", "home_page_url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/", "feed_url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "\ubc31\uc5d4\ub4dc \uc5d4\uc9c0\ub2c8\uc5b4 \uac15\uc601\uaddc\uc758 \uae30\uc220 \ub178\ud2b8 \u2014 \uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c\uacfc \uc778\ud504\ub77c, \uadf8 \uc0ac\uc774\uc758 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uac83", "icon": null, "authors": [{"name": "GYUTORY"}], "language": "ko", "items": [{"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/%EC%B5%9C%EA%B7%BC/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/%EC%B5%9C%EA%B7%BC/", "title": "\ucd5c\uadfc \ubcc0\uacbd \ubb38\uc11c", "content_html": "<h1>\ucd5c\uadfc \ubcc0\uacbd \ubb38\uc11c</h1>\n<p>\ucd5c\uadfc 60\uc77c \ub0b4 \ucd94\uac00\u00b7\uc218\uc815\ub41c \ubb38\uc11c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ube4c\ub4dc \uc2dc\uc810\uc5d0 \uc790\ub3d9 \uc0dd\uc131\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.</p>\n<p>| \ub0a0\uc9dc | \ubb38\uc11c |\n|------|------|\n| 2026-08-08 | <a href=\"AI/Claude/Claude.md\">Claude</a> |\n| 2026-08-08 | [Claude Opus 4...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-08T12:26:30.738730+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-08T12:26:30.738725+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/", "title": "YGSTUDY", "content_html": "<div class=\"yg-home\" markdown=\"0\">\n\n<section class=\"yg-section yg-about yg-about--hero\">\n  <div class=\"yg-about-card\">\n    <div class=\"yg-about-left\">\n      ...", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-08T03:39:46+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-03T07:06:21+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/404/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/404/", "title": "\ud398\uc774\uc9c0\ub97c \ucc3e\uc744 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4", "content_html": "<h1>404 \u2014 \ud398\uc774\uc9c0\ub97c \ucc3e\uc744 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4</h1>\n<p>\uc694\uccad\ud558\uc2e0 \uacbd\ub85c\uac00 \uc874\